Word-cloud rendering is the longest render subcommand only because it
exposes the most presentation knobs.  The CLI flag names mirror the
Python helper's keyword arguments one-for-one, so the slide author can
move a question from one path to the other without re-learning the
options.  [[--extra-stop-word]] is given as a repeated flag because
Typer maps a [[list[str]]] option to one [[--flag value]] pair per
entry, which is exactly how authors will write it on a shell line.

